---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Update installed extensions to latest compatible versions

Usage: specforge update [OPTIONS] [NAME]

Arguments:
  [NAME]
          Extension name (updates all if omitted)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

      --major
          Allow new major versions (otherwise each extension stays within its locked version's caret range); an update never moves an extension to a lower version

      --allow-unsigned
          Accept a package with no publisher signature, when no key is pinned or locked for its name

      --yes
          Accept key changes non-interactively (for CI)

  -h, --help
          Print help
